 ## Operating characteristics
-- **Time Complexity:** Training is significantly slower than vanilla 3DGS. For example, on the "Basement 1" scene, the full method took 28 minutes 30 seconds compared to 6 minutes 56 seconds for vanilla 3DGS [S1]. This is due to the additional render calls required for each layer (2 for diffuse, 3 for full) [S1].
-- **Memory Complexity:** Requires storing three sets of Gaussians. The total number of primitives is higher than vanilla 3DGS (e.g., 2.185M vs 1.558M for Basement 1) [S1].
